<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

45
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:23,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to do my best again today!</font>

46
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:26,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Bushy Brow!</font>

47
00:02:27,540 --> 00:02:29,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... Good morning, Naruto-kun.</font>

48
00:02:29,460 --> 00:02:33,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, did you already get checked out
by Granny Tsunade?</font>

49
00:02:34,050 --> 00:02:35,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How was it, how was it?</font>

50
00:02:39,340 --> 00:02:42,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf Village is
in great trouble right now,</font>

51
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:45,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so we must do our best!</font>

52
00:02:46,810 --> 00:02:48,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're right.</font>

53
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:50,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bushy Brow, you should get better
as soon as possible</font>

54
00:02:50,310 --> 00:02:51,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and succeed in your mis...!</font>

55
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:53,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Naruto nii-chan!
— Naruto nii-chan!</font>

56
00:02:53,940 --> 00:02:55,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?</font>

57
00:02:55,940 --> 00:02:57,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Konohamaru-chan!</font>

58
00:02:57,690 --> 00:02:59,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What's wrong with Konohamaru?</font>

59
00:02:59,990 --> 00:03:01,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's in trouble.</font>

60
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:04,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In trouble?!</font>

61
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:11,290
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The One Who Succeeds</font>

62
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:11,290
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Will of Fire</font>

63
00:03:14,630 --> 00:03:17,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate,
we will have to open it by force.</font>

64
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:21,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Try it! Who do you think I am?!</font>

65
00:03:21,430 --> 00:03:23,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am the grandson of
the Third Hokage!</font>

66
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:25,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you go against me, then...</font>

67
00:03:27,850 --> 00:03:28,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old man...</font>

68
00:03:29,730 --> 00:03:32,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It means you're going
against the Hokage!</font>

69
00:03:32,940 --> 00:03:36,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We need Tsunade-sama
to assume her position immediately.</font>

70
00:03:50,410 --> 00:03:52,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those are Pepper Smoke Bombs!</font>

71
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:55,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll get something even more terrible
if you come close to me.</font>

72
00:03:55,380 --> 00:03:58,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Honorable Grandson! Even for you...</font>

73
00:04:01,090 --> 00:04:03,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are things that can
and cannot be forgiven!</font>

74
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:04,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

75
00:04:08,220 --> 00:04:10,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is all this commotion
so early in the morning?</font>

76
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:12,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's hurting my head.</font>

77
00:04:12,430 --> 00:04:13,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama...</font>

78
00:04:18,610 --> 00:04:21,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just one kid...
What're you doing?</font>

79
00:04:21,190 --> 00:04:22,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

80
00:04:22,740 --> 00:04:24,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get rid of him!</font>

81
00:04:27,780 --> 00:04:30,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's the grandson
of the Third Hokage!</font>

82
00:04:30,910 --> 00:04:33,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter if
he's the grandson or the great grandson.</font>

83
00:04:33,580 --> 00:04:35,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am the granddaughter
of the First Hokage!</font>

84
00:04:38,540 --> 00:04:41,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He might just open his eyes
if he gets roughed up a little.</font>

85
00:04:41,690 --> 00:04:43,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now move it!</font>

86
00:04:43,300 --> 00:04:43,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yes!
— Yes!</font>

87
00:04:47,220 --> 00:04:48,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

88
00:04:48,890 --> 00:04:49,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun?!</font>

89
00:04:51,930 --> 00:04:53,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hold on there.</font>

90
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't really know
what's going on,</font>

91
00:04:55,640 --> 00:04:59,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but don't be so rough with Konohamaru,
Granny Tsunade.</font>

92
00:05:00,010 --> 00:05:01,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An acquaintance of yours?</font>

93
00:05:02,070 --> 00:05:03,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, yes...</font>

94
00:05:04,150 --> 00:05:08,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do the convincing,
leave it to me.</font>

95
00:05:08,530 --> 00:05:10,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, do something
by the end of the day!</font>

96
00:05:12,590 --> 00:05:15,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Tsunade-sama... Please wait!</font>

97
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:24,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me.</font>

98
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:28,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Sakura-chan. Sasuke-kun has already
been discharged from the hospital.</font>

99
00:05:29,170 --> 00:05:32,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm actually here to see Lee-san today.
Is he in the rehabilitation room?</font>

100
00:05:34,930 --> 00:05:38,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not yet.
That's not like him to be late.</font>

101
00:05:39,810 --> 00:05:41,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

102
00:05:47,700 --> 00:05:51,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The probability of a successful surgery
is 50%, at best.</font>

103
00:05:52,410 --> 00:05:54,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And if it fails, you'll die!</font>

104
00:06:03,630 --> 00:06:07,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Konohamaru.
What are you doing in there?!</font>

105
00:06:11,510 --> 00:06:14,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and come out.
Then let's go eat some ramen.</font>

106
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:21,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry. It's on me!</font>

107
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:27,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can have lots of BBQ pork, too!</font>

108
00:06:30,780 --> 00:06:34,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! You can have eggs too!
How about that!</font>

109
00:06:36,540 --> 00:06:38,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At least answer me!</font>

110
00:06:38,460 --> 00:06:39,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up, you fool!</font>

111
00:06:41,670 --> 00:06:44,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You called me a fool!</font>

112
00:06:44,130 --> 00:06:47,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Open up already! I'll break in! Hey!</font>

113
00:06:47,630 --> 00:06:49,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Try if you can!</font>

114
00:06:50,340 --> 00:06:53,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Why you...!</font>

115
00:06:59,980 --> 00:07:01,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Naruto nii-chan...
— Naruto nii-chan!</font>

116
00:07:10,200 --> 00:07:13,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Lee-san... You're here.</font>

117
00:07:14,810 --> 00:07:16,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sakura-san!</font>

118
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted to bring you this.</font>

119
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:26,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">F-For... me?</font>

120
00:07:27,190 --> 00:07:28,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Th-Thank you very much!</font>

121
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'm sorry, Sakura-san.</font>

122
00:07:33,930 --> 00:07:34,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No worries.</font>

123
00:07:36,260 --> 00:07:39,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun is now recuperating at home.</font>

124
00:07:40,140 --> 00:07:41,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks to Tsunade-sama.</font>

125
00:07:41,810 --> 00:07:42,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate,</font>

126
00:07:42,980 --> 00:07:45,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">seems like he'll be able
to get back to his duties very soon.</font>

127
00:07:46,070 --> 00:07:49,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. That's very good.</font>

128
00:07:49,940 --> 00:07:52,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama is great, after all.</font>

129
00:07:52,860 --> 00:07:57,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think if you had her take a look,
you'd get better very quickly.</font>

130
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:02,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

131
00:08:03,420 --> 00:08:06,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if there is something
that I can do,</font>

132
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:08,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">please feel free to tell me.</font>

133
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:13,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you very much, Sakura-san.</font>

134
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:16,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll see you soon.</font>

135
00:08:30,070 --> 00:08:33,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would think that at least
one bar would be open.</font>

136
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:37,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way.
What time do you think it is right now?</font>

137
00:08:37,830 --> 00:08:40,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't drink alcohol, and I can't gamble.</font>

138
00:08:40,790 --> 00:08:44,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This place, the Hidden Leaf Village,
is no fun at all.</font>

139
00:08:45,790 --> 00:08:47,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like the Third Hokage.</font>

140
00:08:47,170 --> 00:08:48,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

141
00:08:48,420 --> 00:08:50,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I'm tired.</font>

142
00:08:51,050 --> 00:08:55,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just want to sit down and
have a drink somewhere.</font>

143
00:08:58,980 --> 00:09:00,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand.</font>

144
00:09:00,810 --> 00:09:04,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will take you to a place where
you can sit and have a drink.</font>

145
00:09:04,940 --> 00:09:05,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

146
00:09:07,100 --> 00:09:09,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I will have you do your work!</font>

147
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:22,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here now, go ahead. It's hot.</font>

148
00:09:24,370 --> 00:09:28,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shizune... you've suddenly
become very strict!</font>

149
00:09:29,380 --> 00:09:34,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I haven't gotten strict.
It's probably that you were not aware.</font>

150
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:35,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not aware?!</font>

151
00:09:36,180 --> 00:09:38,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"If I can't get in the room,
then I don't have to work."</font>

152
00:09:38,930 --> 00:09:41,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that what you were thinking?</font>

153
00:09:42,220 --> 00:09:44,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that's why
you left it up to Naruto-kun.</font>

154
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:47,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph! Could be...</font>

155
00:09:48,270 --> 00:09:51,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the most recent list
of Shinobi.</font>

156
00:09:51,730 --> 00:09:55,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The names and lineups of
the groups have changed a lot.</font>

157
00:09:55,610 --> 00:09:59,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So please look through them.
And I mean, look through all of it!</font>

158
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, boy.</font>

159
00:10:02,910 --> 00:10:04,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They have sweet rice cakes, too.</font>

160
00:10:05,370 --> 00:10:07,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't like sweet things!</font>

161
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:11,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Konohamaru, come out already!</font>

162
00:10:13,420 --> 00:10:17,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At least tell me why you're doing this!</font>

163
00:10:18,590 --> 00:10:19,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru-chan!</font>

164
00:10:20,850 --> 00:10:21,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

165
00:10:22,300 --> 00:10:24,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everybody came here because
they're worried about you!</font>

166
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:27,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't come out,
I'm going to drag you out of there!</font>

167
00:10:27,980 --> 00:10:29,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto Sacred Technique...</font>

168
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:30,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sexy Jutsu!</font>

169
00:10:33,940 --> 00:10:37,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru-kun, come out!</font>

170
00:10:40,070 --> 00:10:44,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru-kun, hurry!</font>

171
00:10:50,170 --> 00:10:55,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Say something at least!
This is so embarrassing!</font>

172
00:10:56,770 --> 00:10:58,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't fool around with me!</font>

173
00:10:59,090 --> 00:11:00,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

174
00:11:02,550 --> 00:11:05,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Stop it already, Konohamaru!
— Stop it already, Konohamaru!</font>

175
00:11:05,140 --> 00:11:06,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, two...</font>

176
00:11:10,560 --> 00:11:13,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Uh, what is this?
— What the...?!</font>

177
00:11:15,230 --> 00:11:17,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?!</font>

178
00:11:17,940 --> 00:11:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay? Naruto nii-chan?</font>

179
00:11:23,410 --> 00:11:26,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the Grandpa's room.</font>

180
00:11:34,590 --> 00:11:38,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eight D-rank missions,
three C-rank missions...</font>

181
00:11:39,380 --> 00:11:41,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, very much like the Kurenai team.</font>

182
00:11:44,140 --> 00:11:47,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can easily figure out
what the Third Hokage was thinking.</font>

183
00:11:51,270 --> 00:11:53,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the same as
their parents' team.</font>

184
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

185
00:11:59,860 --> 00:12:06,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I see. This team has their own specialty
and is well-balanced.</font>

186
00:12:25,590 --> 00:12:26,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My shoulders are stiff.</font>

187
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:28,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to go get
some fresh air outside.</font>

188
00:12:54,650 --> 00:12:55,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Success...</font>

189
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:02,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Success...</font>

190
00:13:15,020 --> 00:13:16,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto nii-chan...</font>

191
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:19,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh... damn!</font>

192
00:13:20,050 --> 00:13:23,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's how you're going to be,
then I'm not going to go easy on you.</font>

193
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:25,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is Grandpa's room!</font>

194
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:27,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let anybody
use this room besides him!</font>

195
00:13:29,830 --> 00:13:31,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandpa's...?</font>

196
00:13:31,620 --> 00:13:34,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why, as his grandson,
I'm going to protect it!</font>

197
00:13:34,330 --> 00:13:36,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool! This isn't the time for that!</font>

198
00:13:36,930 --> 00:13:39,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf Village is in great danger!</font>

199
00:13:39,380 --> 00:13:42,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what?! It doesn't matter to me.</font>

200
00:13:43,340 --> 00:13:45,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you seriously saying that?!</font>

201
00:13:47,630 --> 00:13:50,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, now I'm mad!</font>

202
00:13:50,110 --> 00:13:55,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I can easily tear down one
or two doors with my new powers...!</font>

203
00:13:55,640 --> 00:13:57,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Naruto nii-chan!
— Naruto nii-chan!</font>

204
00:13:59,380 --> 00:14:00,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Granny Tsunade...</font>

205
00:14:01,730 --> 00:14:02,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Watch out!</font>

206
00:14:15,500 --> 00:14:17,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wow...</font>

207
00:15:13,470 --> 00:15:15,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen Konohamaru.</font>

208
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:18,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hidden Leaf Village is
in great trouble right now!</font>

209
00:15:18,520 --> 00:15:23,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our forces have dropped to almost half,
and we have to finish our missions!</font>

210
00:15:25,110 --> 00:15:28,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what I taught you!</font>

211
00:15:30,110 --> 00:15:33,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... um... well...</font>

212
00:15:33,340 --> 00:15:34,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if we don't accomplish
our missions,</font>

213
00:15:34,990 --> 00:15:39,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that's letting other countries know
that the village has been weakened.</font>

214
00:15:39,620 --> 00:15:42,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what Iruka-sensei taught you!</font>

215
00:15:50,340 --> 00:15:52,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you not like Granny Tsunade?</font>

216
00:15:52,430 --> 00:15:54,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not that!
It's not that at all.</font>

217
00:15:55,640 --> 00:15:56,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then what is it?</font>

218
00:15:57,570 --> 00:16:01,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Soon, nobody will call me
Honorable Grandson.</font>

219
00:16:02,060 --> 00:16:04,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll just become
plain old Konohamaru.</font>

220
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:07,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what's wrong with
plain old Konohamaru?</font>

221
00:16:07,730 --> 00:16:08,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

222
00:16:09,110 --> 00:16:14,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why, why?! You hated
being called Honorable Grandson!</font>

223
00:16:16,700 --> 00:16:19,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everybody's going to forget
about Grandpa.</font>

224
00:16:21,370 --> 00:16:22,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandpa.</font>

225
00:16:23,500 --> 00:16:25,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're going to forget what
a great Ninja he was,</font>

226
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:28,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they're just going to put him away
like an old ashtray.</font>

227
00:16:30,010 --> 00:16:33,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The new Hokage will make all kinds
of changes in the Leaf Village.</font>

228
00:16:34,470 --> 00:16:36,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not true!</font>

229
00:16:36,270 --> 00:16:37,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hidden Leaf Village is
the Hidden Leaf Village.</font>

230
00:16:38,010 --> 00:16:41,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And besides,
nobody will forget about the Old Man!</font>

231
00:16:41,890 --> 00:16:44,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! They will never forget about him!</font>

232
00:16:45,100 --> 00:16:47,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They will forget, I guarantee it.</font>

233
00:16:47,980 --> 00:16:49,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They won't forget!</font>

234
00:16:49,070 --> 00:16:49,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a lie!</font>

235
00:16:50,070 --> 00:16:53,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not a lie!
You can't believe what I am saying?!</font>

236
00:16:53,820 --> 00:16:54,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right, I can't!</font>

237
00:16:54,820 --> 00:16:57,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh boy!</font>

238
00:16:57,700 --> 00:16:59,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come with me, Konohamaru!</font>

239
00:16:59,660 --> 00:17:02,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We just have to get Granny Tsunade
to promise</font>

240
00:17:02,080 --> 00:17:04,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that she won't change
the Village Hidden in the Leaves.</font>

241
00:17:04,830 --> 00:17:05,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then on top of that,</font>

242
00:17:05,830 --> 00:17:09,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we can get everybody to promise us
that they won't forget about the Old Man!</font>

243
00:17:09,130 --> 00:17:09,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

244
00:17:10,670 --> 00:17:12,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that what you want?</font>

245
00:17:18,800 --> 00:17:22,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't believe that I let
Tsunade-sama out of my sight!</font>

246
00:17:29,610 --> 00:17:31,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you find her, Tonton?</font>

247
00:17:45,710 --> 00:17:48,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Revitalizing the cells, I see.</font>

248
00:17:57,300 --> 00:17:59,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've found you Tsunade-sama.</font>

249
00:17:59,620 --> 00:18:00,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

250
00:18:04,810 --> 00:18:07,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama is studying?!</font>

251
00:18:08,350 --> 00:18:10,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be quiet! I can't concentrate.</font>

252
00:18:12,730 --> 00:18:13,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Concentrate?!</font>

253
00:18:14,310 --> 00:18:17,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never heard you use that word
except when you're gambling.</font>

254
00:18:18,360 --> 00:18:20,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that Shizune nee-chan's voice?</font>

255
00:18:20,750 --> 00:18:22,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shizune...</font>

256
00:18:25,160 --> 00:18:28,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you remember that Medical Ninja
by the name of Kabuto?</font>

257
00:18:29,370 --> 00:18:30,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about him?</font>

258
00:18:30,500 --> 00:18:34,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His ability to create new cells.</font>

259
00:18:34,590 --> 00:18:37,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was researching ways to use
that power on the patients.</font>

260
00:18:38,800 --> 00:18:40,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For Lee-kun?</font>

261
00:18:40,930 --> 00:18:47,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the 50% chance becomes 51%,
it's worth a try.</font>

262
00:18:47,520 --> 00:18:51,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It really depends on the individual's
traits.</font>

263
00:18:52,410 --> 00:18:55,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even for you,
it might be hard to acquire those powers.</font>

264
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:00,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll just have to try.</font>

265
00:19:02,750 --> 00:19:05,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am the Fifth Hokage, after all.</font>

266
00:19:14,590 --> 00:19:17,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped, Konohamaru.</font>

267
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:20,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am the Third Hokage, after all.</font>

268
00:19:21,040 --> 00:19:24,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't like it,
you should just quit!</font>

269
00:19:24,930 --> 00:19:27,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everybody from the village
is my family.</font>

270
00:19:27,930 --> 00:19:31,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To protect the family,
that is the duty of a Hokage.</font>

271
00:19:34,060 --> 00:19:35,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Grandpa!</font>

272
00:19:50,750 --> 00:19:53,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just for today,
I'm making a special exception.</font>

273
00:19:57,840 --> 00:19:59,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter Konohamaru?</font>

274
00:19:59,800 --> 00:20:02,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you want to see
Grannny Tsunade?</font>

275
00:20:02,510 --> 00:20:03,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No.</font>

276
00:20:12,310 --> 00:20:16,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll just have to do it.
I am the Fifth Hokage, after all.</font>

277
00:20:17,230 --> 00:20:22,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped, Konohamaru.
I am the Third Hokage, after all.</font>

278
00:20:23,740 --> 00:20:27,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped.
I am the Honorable Grandson, after all.</font>

279
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:28,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

280
00:20:29,310 --> 00:20:33,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am Konohamaru of
the Hidden Leaf Village, after all!</font>

281
00:20:33,170 --> 00:20:36,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey Konohamaru, wait!</font>

282
00:20:37,040 --> 00:20:40,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on with him?
Hey, Konohamaru!</font>

283
00:20:47,300 --> 00:20:48,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama?</font>

284
00:20:48,690 --> 00:20:49,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing...</font>

285
00:21:06,230 --> 00:21:11,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I BELIEVE YOUR PROMISE ITS TRUE HEART TO GIVE ME COURAGE</b></font></font>

286
00:21:06,230 --> 00:21:11,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I believe your promise, it's a true heart gives me courage</b></font></font>

287
